[h2]Holster[/h2]
Press [b]H[/b] to put your weapon away. Press it again to draw the same weapon if you still have it, otherwise your first available weapon. Shift+H works while sprinting. Stop moving to put away a launcher. When Zeus is remote-controlling a unit, the key acts on that unit.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Holster[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Holster[/b], check [b]Enable Holster[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

